  "editorial": {
    "name": "rollbar/rollbar-react",
    "descriptionZh": "Rollbar 官方的 React SDK，把 Rollbar.js 包成适配 React 的写法：ErrorBoundary、Provider 这类组件加一批 hooks，另做了 React server component 适配。仓库里带一个 Next.js 14 App Router 的示例工程。",
    "descriptionEn": null,
    "takeawayZh": "用 ErrorBoundary 把报错送进 Rollbar",
    "noteZh": "README 标题 Rollbar React SDK，第一句是 Proactively discover, predict, and resolve errors in real-time with Rollbar's error monitoring platform.，紧接着 React features to enhance using Rollbar.js in React Applications.；目录分 Setup Instructions、Usage and Reference、Components、Functions、Hooks 四段。examples 与 scripts 两个目录的最近提交都写 Example for Next.js 14 using App Router (#122)，rollup.config.mjs 那行是 React server component support (#121)，.npmrc 一行说明加了 ignore-scripts=true 来挡住依赖安装钩子。About 侧栏给 docs.rollbar.com/docs/react，Topics 是 error-monitoring / error-reporting / javascript / observability / react / reactjs / rollbar / typescript，MIT license、46 stars、9 forks、Used by 1.5K，最新 Release v1.0.0。",
    "recommendation": null,
    "pricing": "Free",
    "pricingNote": null
  },
